<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">Our story</span>
    <h1>About LumySmile</h1>
    <p>Gentle, natural oral care for a brighter, more confident smile &mdash; without the harsh chemicals.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="story">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="story__top">
      <div class="story__media">
        {%- assign about_img = all_products['charcoal-whitening-toothpaste'] -%}
        {%- if about_img.featured_media -%}
          <img src="{{ about_img.featured_media | image_url: width: 900 }}" alt="LumySmile natural oral care" width="500" height="500">
        {%- else -%}
          <img src="{{ 'lifestyle-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}" alt="LumySmile" width="500" height="500">
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
      <div class="story__text">
        <h3>Whitening that works with your body, not against it</h3>
        <p>LumySmile started with a simple frustration: whitening that actually works usually means harsh peroxide, sensitivity and a mouth full of chemicals. We believed there was a gentler way &mdash; one built around naturally powerful ingredients like activated charcoal and sustainable bamboo.</p>
        <p>Today we help people brighten their smile the natural way: peroxide-free, enamel-safe, and kind to the planet. No gimmicks &mdash; just clean, effective oral care you can feel good about using every day.</p>
        <ul class="story__values">
          <li><strong>Natural first</strong><span>Charcoal, bamboo and clean formulas &mdash; no artificial dyes.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Gentle &amp; safe</strong><span>Enamel-safe, low-abrasion, peroxide-free by design.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Planet-friendly</strong><span>Biodegradable bamboo and thoughtful materials.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="story__stats">
      <div><span class="story__num">500+</span><span class="story__label">Happy smiles</span></div>
      <div><span class="story__num">4.8&#9733;</span><span class="story__label">Average rating</span></div>
      <div><span class="story__num">7 days</span><span class="story__label">To visible results</span></div>
      <div><span class="story__num">30-day</span><span class="story__label">Money-back guarantee</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="reviews" id="reviews">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Loved by customers</span>
      <h2>Real smiles, real confidence</h2>
      <p class="reviews__rating"><span class="stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span> Rated 4.8/5 by our community</p>
    </div>
    <div class="reviews__grid">
      <figure class="review">
        <div class="stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
        <blockquote>&ldquo;My teeth feel cleaner and look noticeably brighter after a couple of weeks &mdash; and zero sensitivity, which sold me.&rdquo;</blockquote>
        <figcaption>Sarah M.</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="review">
        <div class="stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
        <blockquote>&ldquo;I love that it's natural and peroxide-free. The charcoal toothpaste has become part of my daily routine.&rdquo;</blockquote>
        <figcaption>James T.</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <figure class="review">
        <div class="stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
        <blockquote>&ldquo;The bamboo brushes feel great and I like knowing they're better for the planet. Great little bundle.&rdquo;</blockquote>
        <figcaption>Am&eacute;lie R.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="guarantee">
  <div class="container guarantee__inner">
    <div class="guarantee__icon" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="46" height="46"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.5-3 8-7 10-4-2-7-5.5-7-10V6l7-3Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M8.5 12l2.5 2.5 4.5-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2>Ready to brighten your smile?</h2>
      <p>Join hundreds of happy customers and try LumySmile risk-free for 30 days.</p>
    </div>
    <a href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}" class="btn btn--light btn--lg">Shop now</a>
  </div>
</section>
